flowchart TB
  W[Structured review artifact] --> T{Mandatory review trigger?}
  T -- No --> C[Complete nonconsequential evidence artifact]
  T -- Yes --> P[Persist awaiting human review checkpoint]
  P --> Q[Create unique shared review task]
  Q --> R[Authorized reviewer opens claim workspace]
  R --> Z[Reauthorize tenant claim and role]
  Z --> S{Checkpoint version current?}
  S -- No --> STALE[Return 409 and reload]
  S -- Yes --> E[Show evidence citations signals history and proposals]
  E --> D{Human artifact action plus reason}
  D --> DONE[Acknowledge approve proposal or reject proposal]
  D --> MORE[Request information or return for evidence]
  DONE --> A[Persist actor action checkpoint event and audit]
  MORE --> A
  A --> F[Resume to completed or awaiting additional information]
  B[Claim approval denial payment external contact or close] -. never available .-> P
